BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eu-ai-act-2025-02-02@enterpriseai.tools
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250202
SUMMARY:EU AI Act: Prohibited AI practices and AI literacy
DESCRIPTION:In force. Bans on unacceptable-risk practices (Article 5) and
  deployer AI-literacy duties (Article 4) apply. Source: https://digital-
 strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/regulatory-framework-ai
URL:https://www.enterpriseai.tools/eu-ai-act/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eu-ai-act-2025-08-02@enterpriseai.tools
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250802
SUMMARY:EU AI Act: Governance rules and general-purpose AI model obligati
 ons
DESCRIPTION:In force. GPAI model transparency obligations and the AI Act 
 governance bodies apply\; Commission enforcement powers over GPAI provid
 ers begin 2 August 2026. Source: https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/e
 n/policies/regulatory-framework-ai
URL:https://www.enterpriseai.tools/eu-ai-act/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eu-ai-act-2026-08-02@enterpriseai.tools
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260802
SUMMARY:EU AI Act: General application of the AI Act
DESCRIPTION:The AI Act's general application date. Regulation (EU) 2026/1
 744 moved Sections 1–3 of the high-risk chapter to fixed later dates whi
 le other obligations due on this date continue to apply. Source: https:/
 /eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2026/1744/oj/eng
URL:https://www.enterpriseai.tools/eu-ai-act/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eu-ai-act-2027-12-02@enterpriseai.tools
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271202
SUMMARY:EU AI Act: Stand-alone Annex III high-risk AI systems
DESCRIPTION:Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 fixes this application date for Sec
 tions 1–3 of the high-risk chapter as they apply to stand-alone Annex II
 I high-risk systems. Source: https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2026/1744
 /oj/eng
URL:https://www.enterpriseai.tools/eu-ai-act/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eu-ai-act-2028-08-02@enterpriseai.tools
DTSTAMP:20260913T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20280802
SUMMARY:EU AI Act: High-risk AI systems embedded in regulated products
DESCRIPTION:Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 fixes this application date for Sec
 tions 1–3 of the high-risk chapter as they apply to Annex I product-embe
 dded systems. Source: https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2026/1744/oj/eng
URL:https://www.enterpriseai.tools/eu-ai-act/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
